sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant K as Keywarden
  participant A as Agent
  participant S as Server

  U->>K: Upload SSH public key
  K->>K: Issue SSH user certificate
  U->>K: Request server access
  Admin->>K: Approve access request
  A->>K: Poll heartbeat/accounts/ssh-ca
  K-->>A: Approved users + CA public key
  A->>S: Enforce accounts + SSH CA trust
  U->>S: SSH using key + certificate
  K->>K: Revoke/expire access
  A->>K: Next poll cycle
  K-->>A: Updated account state
  A->>S: Remove or lock account access

